  ('MEDICAL_KNOWLEDGE', (select id from public.knowledge_documents where title = 'HbA1c (glycated haemoglobin)'), 0, 'HbA1c (glycated haemoglobin)
HbA1c measures the proportion of haemoglobin in the blood that has glucose attached to it. Because red blood cells live for about three months, HbA1c reflects average blood glucose over roughly the preceding 8 to 12 weeks rather than at the moment of the test. It does not require fasting.
The American Diabetes Association describes these categories for adults who are not pregnant: below 5.7 percent is considered normal; 5.7 to 6.4 percent is the range described as prediabetes; 6.5 percent or above on two separate tests is one of the criteria used for diagnosing diabetes.', '[-0.012126442976295948,-0.0041703516617417336,-0.11577695608139038,0.04570012167096138,-0.010598489083349705,-0.0032641198486089706,0.013704839162528515,0.03879804164171219,-0.062414996325969696,-0.017287762835621834,-0.06865116953849792,-0.02324429340660572,-0.12842093408107758,-0.07687753438949585,-0.07368043810129166,-0.012352106161415577,0.08094099164009094,-0.09331339597702026,0.025595031678676605,-0.008446656167507172,0.017967864871025085,-0.00005477625745697878,0.0771075189113617,0.02236449532210827,0.06497716903686523,-0.07295481860637665,-0.015711456537246704,0.06034528464078903,-0.0525842048227787,0.027723778039216995,0.002561958972364664,-0.005909881088882685,0.05818590894341469,0.05048016086220741,-0.06645845621824265,0.05310947075486183,-0.022737665101885796,-0.08286192268133163,-0.03753327205777168,-0.02844218909740448,0.11162727326154709,0.025174524635076523,-0.027029693126678467,0.05576547980308533,-0.03927607461810112,0.0038309653755277395,-0.0030653872527182102,0.0387643463909626,-0.047445204108953476,0.06210949644446373,-0.02939242124557495,-0.01704849675297737,-0.05592024326324463,0.011528505012392998,0.02950112521648407,0.044195838272571564,-0.1113186627626419,0.023355519399046898,0.11483123153448105,-0.08312799036502838,-0.09546153247356415,0.03857582435011864,0.05756397917866707,-0.024850977584719658,0.044515013694763184,-0.03170648217201233,0.03752724826335907,-0.07106039673089981,0.04724932089447975,0.03032664954662323,-0.06756642460823059,0.028109071776270866,-0.00887066125869751,0.020409977063536644,-0.061909738928079605,-0.009040714241564274,-0.057742584496736526,0.026627542451024055,0.0456990972161293,-0.08770152926445007,-0.011054940521717072,0.015066